event: response.reasoning_summary_text.done
data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","item_id":"rs_00fbfb6c481e21c9016ac96359a99887d2befcae514384a1ba","output_index":0,"sequence_number":85,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering implementation strategies**\n\nI'm looking into implementing shared body helpers for routes to avoid duplication. I think this could help streamline the process and make it more efficient! \n\nFor the UI, I need to add functions related to tasks. I’m exploring the need for tests; if no browser is available, maybe we can skip DOM testing, but that could be a big assumption. I wonder how much I should rely on API testing instead."}

